持续<font color=\"red\">2</font>回合。\n</p>\n</td>\n<td class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:10%;\"><img alt=\"技能范围 1-3十字 3X3外1.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/e/e4/pc17wgaj55xp5o81fom4drq48tyg7v4.png/80px-%E6%8A%80%E8%83%BD%E8%8C%83%E5%9B%B4_1-3%E5%8D%81%E5%AD%97_3X3%E5%A4%961.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"80\" height=\"80\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/e/e4/pc17wgaj55xp5o81fom4drq48tyg7v4.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"90\" data-file-height=\"90\" />\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n</div>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"width:100%;text-align:center\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th colspan=\"2\">可习得该技能的角色\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<th style=\"width:10%;\"><b>门外</b>\n</th>\n<td style=\"text-align:left\"><div style=\"display: flex;justify-content: space-evenly;width: fit-content;flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E5%9F%83%E6%8B%89%E6%9B%BC%E9%87%8D%E6%96%A7%E6%96%97%E5%A3%AB\" title=\"角色图鉴库/埃拉曼重斧斗士\"><img alt=\"头像 埃拉曼重斧斗士.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/9/9b/5aikqmpmc6nhoeedvsnmzsde1qz5ivl.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div class=\"hero_head_name\" style=\"width:70px;\"><font color=\"#fff\">埃拉曼重斧斗士</font></div>\n</div><div class=\"hero_head\" style=\"width:70px;height:70px;\">\n<div class=\"hero_head_img\"><a href=\"/llzj/%E8%A7%92%E8%89%B2%E5%9B%BE%E9%89%B4%E5%BA%93/%E4%BD%A3%E5%85%B5%E2%80%9C%E9%A3%8E%E6%9A%B4%E7%A5%9E%E6%96%A7%E2%80%9D\" title=\"角色图鉴库/佣兵“风暴神斧”\"><img alt=\"头像 佣兵“风暴神斧”.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/5/56/qbrfu0bvtqqbnxnwm75hcxwn8c77vco.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"70\" height=\"70\" class=\"img-kk\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"64\" /></a></div>\n<div clas